OL,3,GNEWSACare companies 'profiteering' as
OL,4,Acouncil costs soar
OL,5,
OL,6,FCosts of caring for five vulnerable
OL,7,Fchildren hit #3m a year as companies
OL,8,F"profiteer" from providing specialist
OL,9,Fservices, a council's deputy leader has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FWest Berkshire Council overspent by
OL,13,F#9.3m for the first three months of the
OL,14,Ffinancial year, in part because of the
OL,15,Fneed to pay for some children's
OL,16,Fspecialist care and increasing demand.
OL,18,FDeputy leader Heather Codling said
OL,19,Fcompanies are taking advantage of
OL,20,Fcouncils being unable to provide the
OL,21,Fservices themselves.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
